---
description: Notify Muse (via Tailscale) when an agent task is finished
alwaysApply: true
---

When you have FULLY completed the user's task (all edits done, no
questions pending), run this terminal command as your very last step:

C:\cursor-notify\done.bat "<one short line summarising what was done>"

Rules:
- Run it exactly once, only at the very end, never mid-task.
- If the task failed or you are blocked, run it anyway with the
  summary starting with "BLOCKED:" or "FAILED:".
- When you START a long task, first run:
  C:\cursor-notify\running.bat "<short task name>"
